# Native PUB template samples are user content and stay on a maintainer's disk:
# they are never committed. The evidence tests verify against their real bytes when
# present, and tests/TestSampleSupport.cs writes synthetic containers of the same
# shape when they are not. What the samples taught us is written up in
# docs/SAMPLE_FINDINGS.md; the files themselves are not the licence's "source".
examples/*.dta
